flowchart TB
accTitle: Bind a federated identity to an S3 prefix
accDescr: A trusted SAML identity provider supplies employee 42 as a protected role-session tag, which scopes both listing and object access to that employee prefix.
AD["Employee authenticates with Active Directory"] --> IDP["Trusted SAML identity provider"]
IDP -->|Signed identity: employee 42| STS["STS temporary role session"]
STS --> TAG["Protected employee tag: 42"]
TAG --> L["ListBucket: prefix home/42/*"]
TAG --> O["Get and Put: object ARN home/42/*"]
L --> S[("S3 home/42/")]
O --> S
TAG -.-> N["Other employee prefixes not authorized"]
class AD,IDP inputData
class TAG decision
class S storage
class N warning
